## 🎮 Game Description

**Color Catcher** is a simple and addictive reaction-based game where the player must catch falling colored blocks by clicking on them before they reach the bottom of the screen. The faster you catch the blocks, the higher your score. If a block reaches the bottom, the game ends. The game becomes progressively harder as time goes on.

