# Space Invaders: Mini Edition

A simple text-based version of the classic Space Invaders game.

## 🎮 Game Description

In this game, you control a spaceship at the bottom of the screen and must shoot incoming alien invaders before they reach the bottom of the screen. The player can move left/right and fire bullets. The game ends when all invaders reach the bottom.

## 📱 How to Play

1. Run the game using:  
   ```bash
   python space_invaders.py
   ```

2. Use the **arrow keys** to move the spaceship left and right.
3. Press the **spacebar** to shoot.
